'''The Prince and the Revenant''' (王子と死霊, ''Ōji to Shiryō'', '''The Prince and the Dead Spirit''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 1 Dark [[Catseye]] as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[Dogsville (Merciless)|Dogsville]] and [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)|Last of the Dead]] respectively. To unlock The Prince and the Revenant, you must clear both Wanwan's Glory and Z-Onel Rises!.

